#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:7
msgid "Run an optimization with the high-level API"
msgstr "高レベルAPIで最適化を実行する"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:9
msgid ""
"The prerequisite is an objective function and bounds for the design "
"variables."
msgstr "前提は、目的関数と設計変数の範囲が決まっていることです。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "What you'll be able to do"
msgstr "このページでできるようになること"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:13
msgid ""
"By the end of this page, you'll be able to run minimization or "
"maximization and retrieve solutions and run information from `Result`."
msgstr "このページを終えると、最小化または最大化を実行し、`Result` から解と実行状況を取得できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:16
msgid ""
"This page runs a basic problem with the high-level API; to choose "
"components individually, see [Swap built-in "
"components](component_swap.md). For per-generation state access or finer "
"configuration, continue to the [low-level API](lowlevel_api.md)."
msgstr ""
"基本的な問題を高レベルAPIで実行するページとして、構成要素を個別に選ぶ場合は "
"[ビルトインコンポーネントの差し替え](component_swap.md) を参照してください。 世代ごとの状態取得や細かな構成が必要なら "
"[低レベルAPI](lowlevel_api.md) に進みます。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:19
msgid "Set up the problem"
msgstr "Problemを準備する"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:21
msgid ""
"The high-level API accepts `dim`, `lb`, and `ub` together with the "
"objective function. The objective function receives an array of design "
"variables and returns a scalar or an array with one value per objective."
msgstr ""
"目的関数を受け取る高レベルAPIでは、`dim`、`lb`、`ub` を同時に渡します。 "
"目的関数は、設計変数の配列を受け取り、スカラーまたは目的数に対応する配列を返します。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:44
msgid ""
"If you have already constructed a `Problem`, pass that instance as the "
"first argument. See the [Problem "
"concept](../concepts/problem_and_ranking/problem.md) for objective "
"directions, variables, and constraints. The [Canonical "
"Imports](../api/imports.md) page summarizes import choices."
msgstr "`Problem`をすでに構築している場合は、そのインスタンスを第一引数に渡します。目的方向、変数、制約については[Problemの概念](../concepts/problem_and_ranking/problem.md)を参照してください。[正規インポート](../api/imports.md)のページにインポートの選択肢をまとめています。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:48
msgid "Choose minimize or maximize"
msgstr "minimizeとmaximizeを選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:50
msgid ""
"When all objectives have the same direction, the function name expresses "
"the intent. By default, `minimize` minimizes every objective and "
"`maximize` maximizes every objective."
msgstr ""
"目的方向が一つなら、関数名で実行の意図を表せます。 `minimize` は既定で全目的を最小化し、`maximize` "
"は既定で全目的を最大化します。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "要件"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Call"
msgstr "呼び出し"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Additional specification"
msgstr "追加の指定"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Minimize all objectives"
msgstr "すべて最小化"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "`minimize(...)`"
msgstr "`minimize(...)`"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Maximize all objectives"
msgstr "すべて最大化"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "`maximize(...)`"
msgstr "`maximize(...)`"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Directions already defined by `Problem`"
msgstr "`Problem`で方向を定義済み"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "`minimize(problem)` or `maximize(problem)`"
msgstr "`minimize(problem)` または `maximize(problem)`"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Uses the directions from `Problem`"
msgstr "`Problem` の方向が使われる"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Mix directions across objectives"
msgstr "複数目的の方向を混在させる"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "`minimize(..., direction=[...])`"
msgstr "`minimize(..., direction=[...])`"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:10
msgid "Specify `minimize` or `maximize` for each objective"
msgstr "目的ごとに `minimize` または `maximize` を指定"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:60
msgid ""
"See [Multi-objective optimization](multi_objective.md) for multiple "
"objectives and directions, [Constrained optimization](constraints.md) for"
" constraints, and [Mixed-variable optimization](mixed_variable.md) for "
"mixed variables."
msgstr ""
"多目的の目的関数や方向の定義は [多目的最適化](multi_objective.md) に、制約は "
"[制約付き最適化](constraints.md) に、混合変数は [混合変数](mixed_variable.md) に分けています。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:62
msgid "Control the run"
msgstr "実行を制御する"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:64
msgid ""
"`max_fe` is the upper bound on true objective evaluations. When omitted, "
"the default is `200 * dim`. `pop_size` sets the population size, `seed` "
"sets the initialization seed, and `verbose=False` suppresses generation "
"logs."
msgstr ""
"`max_fe` は真の目的関数評価の上限です。 省略時は `200 * dim` が使われます。 `pop_size` "
"は集団サイズ、`seed` は初期化に使う乱数シード、`verbose=False` は世代ログの抑制に使います。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:68
msgid ""
"To choose built-in Algorithm, Surrogate, and Strategy components, pass "
"strings or instances to `algorithm`, `surrogate`, and `strategy`. The "
"[Swap built-in components](component_swap.md) page covers the selection "
"and swapping procedure."
msgstr ""
"アルゴリズム、Surrogate、Strategyをビルトインコンポーネントから選ぶ場合は、文字列またはインスタンスを "
"`algorithm`、`surrogate`、`strategy` に渡せます。 選択と差替えの手順は "
"[ビルトインコンポーネントを差し替える](component_swap.md) に分けています。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:71
msgid "Read Result"
msgstr "Resultを読む"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:73
msgid ""
"`minimize()` and `maximize()` return a `Result`. For a single objective, "
"`result.x` holds the best design variables and `result.f` holds the "
"corresponding objective value as a one-element array. `result.fe` is the "
"number of true evaluations, and `result.gen` is the number of completed "
"generations. For multiple objectives, `x` and `f` are matrices of Pareto "
"solutions."
msgstr ""
"`minimize()` と `maximize()` は `Result` を返します。 単目的では `result.x` "
"が最良設計変数、`result.f` が要素数1の配列として対応する目的値を保持します。 `result.fe` "
"は真の評価回数、`result.gen` は完了した世代数です。 多目的では `x` と `f` がPareto解の行列になります。"

#: ../../tutorials/highlevel_api.md:87
msgid ""
"`result.ctx` is the complete `OptimizationState`. For per-generation "
"state access, intermediate stopping, or component assembly, continue to "
"the [low-level API](lowlevel_api.md)."
msgstr ""
"`result.ctx` は完全な `OptimizationState` です。 "
"世代ごとの状態取得、途中の停止、コンポーネントの組み立てが必要になったら [低レベルAPI](lowlevel_api.md) に進みます。"

